                                       BUSINESSS QUESTION
Which trading days recorded the biggest positive price movement?

                Query
SELECT
	EXTRACT (DAY FROM date) AS trending_days,
	ROUND(close - open,2) AS price_movement
FROM stock_data
WHERE close > open
ORDER BY price_movement DESC;


Insight:
Some trading days recorded extremely strong positive price movements, showing periods of high investor demand and bullish market activity.
